  "subject": "chore: bump version to v1.0.2061",
  "body": "Signed-off-by: Zach Aller <zach_aller@intuit.com>\n",
  "references": [
    {
      "commit": {
        "author": "\"Zach Aller\" <code@example.com>",
        "date": "2026-10-09T05:32:44-05:00",
        "subject": "test: retry direct Secret finalizer writes and wait for the timed gate's CommitStatus (#2281)",
        "body": "The integration suite's API server can reject writes (K8S_FAULT_PROBABILITY,\non in CI). Two specs assumed a single write succeeds:\n\n- The Secret finalizer specs call ensure/removeSecretFinalizerForProvider\n  once. Retry them in Eventually, as a reconcile would.\n- The long-duration TimedCommitStatus spec waits for the gate's status, then\n  checks its CommitStatus in a Consistently. The status can land before the\n  CommitStatus when the CommitStatus write is rejected, so wait for both.\n\n\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01KMbKRJK45xAEBq9tQoc9DG\n\nSigned-off-by: Michael Crenshaw <350466+crenshaw-dev@users.noreply.github.com>\nCo-authored-by: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>",
        "sha": "363dd0eff5ab82881bbecfa4106c5c5942c0dd8b",
        "repoUrl": "https://github.com/argoproj-labs/gitops-promoter"
      }
    }
  ]
}
